  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom with this custom-themed bedding set from Jeminise. Featuring a bold graphic design of a semi truck on a metallic mesh background, this comforter set is tailored for truckers and truck enthusiasts who live life like a legend. Personalization options allow you to customize the set with your own name, making it a unique addition to your home or a thoughtful gift for family and friends.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features a custom text input field where you can add your name directly onto the design.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping and shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Twin (68\" x 88\"), Full (78\" x 88\"), Queen (88\" x 88\"), and King (104\" x 88\") sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes as a comforter set with optional matching pillowcases and flat sheets to suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, separates easily, and air dries quickly without heat to remain soft and fluffy.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Silver Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
